===Etymology 2===
The {{glossary|noun}} is probably a {{back-formation|en|prise|nocap=1}}, {{m|en|prize|t=tool for levering, lever}}, construed as the {{glossary|plural}} of {{m|en||pry}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|4}}|noformat=1|id=153664|date=December 2020}}</ref>

The {{glossary|verb}} is either derived from the noun, or is a {{back-formation|en|prise|t=to force open with a lever|nocap=1}}, construed as {{m|en|pries}}, the {{glossary|third-person}} {{glossary|singular}} {{glossary|present}} form of {{m|en||pry}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''v.''{{sup|2}}|noformat=1|id=153666|date=December 2020|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|alt=pry{{sup|2}}|pos=v}}</ref>

